Cell["\<\
The inner loop runs in compiled Rust code via LibraryLink using all CPU cores \
and checks for user aborts at every step.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->970785311,ExpressionUUID->"ee6301e5-27bd-4f29-aa43-335fe21be36a"],

